      "expected": "TXLED and RXLED should be separate nets. The isolated CAN transceiver U11 should connect like U10: U11.3/TXD to TXLED/U8.1 and U11.2/RXD to RXLED/U8.2, not the same pin on both nets.",
      "evidence": [
